					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					1063.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἀὴρ ὁ θ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Resp.</u>
					480a30
				</span></i>
