				<u>PA</u>
				642b1
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ θ.</span>
			<i>foreigners, the enemy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				193
			</span></i>. </div>
